 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">인포그래픽스 등 다양한 형태로 제작<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전문가 인터뷰 및 경제현장</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">행사 등 취재<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">자유광장 블로그 홍보 및 소셜마케터 활동&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동기간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2013. 8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ 2013. 12</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\"><br>□ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">활동혜택<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경제이슈 강연 및 세미나 참석<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">콘텐츠 제작</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, SNS, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기사 작성 등 다양한 역량강화 교육<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">정기 활동비 지급<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-tex